{"seq":3,"slug":"age-delivery-carrier-instruction","title":"承运商年龄核验指令与回传（联121/125）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/age-restricted-commerce-verification/age-verified-delivery/age-delivery-carrier-instruction","wordCount":1624,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"承运商年龄核验指令与回传-联121-125\">承运商年龄核验指令与回传（联121/125）</h1><p>平台与承运商之间的年龄核验能力，最终表现为一组接口契约：平台在发货时把「这单需要什么级别的签收核验」作为指令传下去，承运商在派送后把「实际核验到什么结果」回传上来。这两端的数据结构如果不一致，就会出现两类典型故障——承运商按自己的默认档位派送（平台以为要求了 21 岁核验，实际做的是 18 岁核验），以及回传的结果无法与订单对应（核验记录成了孤儿数据，对账时无法归因）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-指令的下行契约\">核心概念：指令的下行契约</h2><p>下行指令的核心是把前几章解析出的判定结果转成承运商能理解的字段。承运商各有自己的字段命名与取值域，因此中间必须有一层映射。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>映射目标示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>required_min_age</code></td>\n<td>该单需核验到的最低年龄</td>\n<td>承运商档位码（18/19/21）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>signature_required</code></td>\n<td>是否必须本人签收</td>\n<td>布尔标志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transferable</code></td>\n<td>是否允许转交他人</td>\n<td>按档位推导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>id_check</code></td>\n<td>是否必须查看证件</td>\n<td>布尔标志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>failure_terminal</code></td>\n<td>未达年龄是否为终态</td>\n<td>承运商行为标记</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 <code>failure_terminal</code> 是需要与承运商明确约定的一项。这部分承运商的默认行为是把所有未完成投递都当作「可重投」，如果不显式告知「未达年龄不要重投」，承运商系统会自动把它排进重投队列，从而产生第 8 篇讨论过的重复尝试问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;shipment_id&quot;: &quot;shp_01J8Z7...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;order_ref&quot;: &quot;ord_77213&quot;,&#10;  &quot;service&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;tier&quot;: &quot;adult_signature_restricted&quot;,&#10;    &quot;required_min_age&quot;: 21,&#10;    &quot;id_check&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;transferable&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;failure_terminal_codes&quot;: [&quot;underage&quot;, &quot;refused&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;callback&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://api.example.com/hooks/carrier-age-check&quot;,&#10;    &quot;idempotency_key_field&quot;: &quot;carrier_record_ref&quot;,&#10;    &quot;signature_algo&quot;: &quot;hmac-sha256&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;compliance&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;market&quot;: &quot;US&quot;,&#10;    &quot;attribute&quot;: &quot;AGE_ALCOHOL&quot;,&#10;    &quot;regulation_ref&quot;: &quot;state_law:XX-123.4&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"shipment_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shp_01J8Z7...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ord_77213\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"adult_signature_restricted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"required_min_age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">21</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"id_check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"transferable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"failure_terminal_codes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"underage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refused\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"callback\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.example.com/hooks/carrier-age-check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"idempotency_key_field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"carrier_record_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"signature_algo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hmac-sha256\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compliance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"attribute\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AGE_ALCOHOL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"regulation_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"state_law:XX-123.4\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>failure_terminal_codes</code> 与 <code>idempotency_key_field</code> 是两个最能减少故障的字段。前者把业务规则翻译成承运商可执行的行为约束；后者告诉承运商（以及平台自己的接收端）用哪个字段做幂等去重，避免重传导致重复记账。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[平台判定&lt;br/&gt;门槛+档位] --&gt; B[映射为承运商档位码]&#10;  B --&gt; C[下发发货指令&lt;br/&gt;含终态码与幂等键]&#10;  C --&gt; D[承运商派送系统]&#10;  D --&gt; E[司机执行核验]&#10;  E --&gt; F[承运商回传核验结果]&#10;  F --&gt; G{签名与幂等校验}&#10;  G --&gt;|通过| H[写入 delivery_age_check]&#10;  G --&gt;|失败| I[拒绝并告警]&#10;  H --&gt; J[对账与度量]\">graph TD\n  A[平台判定&lt;br/&gt;门槛+档位] --&gt; B[映射为承运商档位码]\n  B --&gt; C[下发发货指令&lt;br/&gt;含终态码与幂等键]\n  C --&gt; D[承运商派送系统]\n  D --&gt; E[司机执行核验]\n  E --&gt; F[承运商回传核验结果]\n  F --&gt; G{签名与幂等校验}\n  G --&gt;|通过| H[写入 delivery_age_check]\n  G --&gt;|失败| I[拒绝并告警]\n  H --&gt; J[对账与度量]</pre><h2 id=\"回传的上行契约\">回传的上行契约</h2><p>回传侧的首要要求是<strong>可对应</strong>：每一条核验结果必须能唯一地对应到一次派送尝试，进而对应到订单。承运商回传里通常不含平台订单号，因此需要一层关联——通过发货时下发的 <code>shipment_id</code> 或承运商的运单号关联。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 回传受理：幂等 + 关联 + 落库&#10;WITH incoming AS (&#10;  SELECT :carrier_code AS carrier_code,&#10;         :record_ref   AS carrier_record_ref,&#10;         :shipment_id  AS shipment_id,&#10;         :result       AS attempt_result,&#10;         :min_age      AS required_min_age,&#10;         :assertion    AS age_assertion,&#10;         :attempted_at AS attempted_at&#10;)&#10;INSERT INTO delivery_age_check (&#10;  id, order_id, carrier_code, service_tier, required_min_age,&#10;  attempt_result, age_assertion, id_data_retained,&#10;  carrier_record_ref, attempted_at, received_at&#10;)&#10;SELECT gen_random_uuid(), s.order_id, i.carrier_code, s.service_tier,&#10;       i.required_min_age, i.attempt_result, i.age_assertion, false,&#10;       i.carrier_record_ref, i.attempted_at, now()&#10;FROM incoming i&#10;JOIN shipment s ON s.shipment_id = i.shipment_id&#10;ON CONFLICT (carrier_code, carrier_record_ref) DO NOTHING;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 回传受理：幂等 + 关联 + 落库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> incoming </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :carrier_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_code,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         :record_ref   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_record_ref,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         :shipment_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         :result       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt_result,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         :min_age      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> required_min_age,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         :assertion    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_assertion,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         :attempted_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempted_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delivery_age_check (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id, order_id, carrier_code, service_tier, required_min_age,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attempt_result, age_assertion, id_data_retained,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  carrier_record_ref, attempted_at, received_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gen_random_uuid(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">service_tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">required_min_age</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attempt_result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">age_assertion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier_record_ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attempted_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> incoming i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (carrier_code, carrier_record_ref) DO NOTHING;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ON CONFLICT ... DO NOTHING</code> 是幂等落地的关键。承运商的重传是常态而非异常——网络超时后承运商无法确认平台是否收到，通常会重发。没有幂等约束会让同一次核验被计入多次，直接影响后续所有基于计数的度量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"关联失败的处理\">关联失败的处理</h3><p>回传无法关联到发货记录（<code>shipment_id</code> 未匹配）是必然会发生的，原因包括承运商回传了平台的测试单、运单号被人工修改、或跨系统数据延迟。这类数据不能静默丢弃——静默丢弃会让覆盖率指标虚高。正确的做法是写入一张<strong>孤儿表</strong>并触发告警，人工或定时任务排查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承运商能力的登记与路由\">承运商能力的登记与路由</h2><p>不同承运商、甚至同一承运商的不同线路，可提供的档位不同。系统需要维护一份能力登记，用于发货路由时的可行性判定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>承运商</th>\n<th>线路</th>\n<th>支持档位</th>\n<th>核验年龄</th>\n<th>回传方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>全境</td>\n<td>成人签收</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>API 实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>偏远</td>\n<td>普通签收</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>API 实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>全境</td>\n<td>成人签收 + 限制投递</td>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>批量文件（每日）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表里最值得注意的是回传方式的差异：批量文件（每日）意味着平台在派送当天无法实时获知核验结果，风控的实时判断会有一天的盲区。对于高风险订单，应当优先路由到能实时回传的承运商——这是一个真实的、必须显式进入路由决策的约束，而不是一个可以忽略的实现细节。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 发货路由：档位可行 + 回传时效满足风险要求&#10;SELECT c.carrier_code, c.service_tier, c.callback_mode,&#10;       c.max_supported_age&#10;FROM carrier_capability c&#10;JOIN shipment s ON s.shipment_id = :shipment_id&#10;WHERE c.lane_code = s.lane_code&#10;  AND c.max_supported_age &gt;= s.required_min_age&#10;  AND (s.risk_bucket &lt;&gt; &#39;high&#39; OR c.callback_mode = &#39;api_realtime&#39;)&#10;ORDER BY c.cost_rank&#10;LIMIT 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 发货路由：档位可行 + 回传时效满足风险要求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">service_tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">callback_mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max_supported_age</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_capability c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :shipment_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lane_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lane_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max_supported_age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">required_min_age</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">risk_bucket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">callback_mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'api_realtime'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cost_rank</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询里的第二个条件是最容易被漏掉的：高风险订单不能走批量回传的线路。把它写进路由的 WHERE 子句，比写进某处注释要可靠得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"考核与责任\">考核与责任</h2><p>承运商核验的执行质量应当进入承运商的考核体系（与 <code>121_carrier-performance-management</code> 的考核框架对接）。可用的考核指标与第 1 篇的对账指标一致：核验覆盖率、漏回传率、回传延迟、以及 <code>no_id</code> 率。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>考核项</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n<th>责任归属</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核验覆盖率</td>\n<td>有回传 / 应核验单</td>\n<td>承运商执行与系统对接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏回传率</td>\n<td>无回传 / 应核验单</td>\n<td>承运商接口可靠性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回传延迟中位数</td>\n<td><code>received_at - attempted_at</code></td>\n<td>承运商集成质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>no_id</code> 率异常</td>\n<td>相对承运商基线偏离</td>\n<td>司机培训与执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>考核的意义不只是追责，更重要的是让「核验执行」这件事有可见的反馈回路。在一个没有度量的系统里，核验要求会随着时间逐渐退化为形式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>为什么错</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只下发档位不下发终态码</td>\n<td>承运商会把 <code>underage</code> 排进重投</td>\n<td>显式传 <code>failure_terminal_codes</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回传不做幂等</td>\n<td>重传污染所有计数指标</td>\n<td>用唯一键 + <code>ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联失败的数据静默丢弃</td>\n<td>覆盖率虚高，问题被掩盖</td>\n<td>写孤儿表并告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽略回传方式的时效差异</td>\n<td>高风险订单存在风控盲区</td>\n<td>高风险订单强制走实时回传线路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核验质量不进考核</td>\n<td>要求随时间退化为形式</td>\n<td>覆盖率与漏回传率进承运商考核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>平台与承运商之间的年龄核验契约，决定了纸面要求能否变成门口的实际动作。要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>下行指令必须包含档位、是否可转交、是否查证件、以及<strong>哪些结果不可重投</strong></li>\n<li>回传必须可对应且幂等，唯一约束是防重传污染的硬要求</li>\n<li>关联失败的回传写入孤儿表并告警，不可静默丢弃</li>\n<li>承运商能力登记要包含回传方式，高风险订单强制走实时回传线路</li>\n<li>核验覆盖率与漏回传率应进入承运商考核，形成反馈回路</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核验动作本身在门口是怎么执行的，见 <a href=\"age-check-on-delivery-id\">配送签收人年龄/证件核验与持证派送</a>。失败结果的处置规则见 <a href=\"adult-signature-attempt-fail\">成人签收/无人签收/失败重试处置</a>。这些核验记录如何留存与举证，见 <a href=\"../age-gate-record-risk/age-verification-retention-minimal\">年龄验证记录最小化留存与举证</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"承运商年龄核验指令与回传（联121/125）","id":"承运商年龄核验指令与回传-联121-125"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：指令的下行契约","id":"核心概念-指令的下行契约"},{"level":2,"text":"回传的上行契约","id":"回传的上行契约"},{"level":3,"text":"关联失败的处理","id":"关联失败的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"承运商能力的登记与路由","id":"承运商能力的登记与路由"},{"level":2,"text":"考核与责任","id":"考核与责任"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"成人签收/无人签收/失败重试处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/age-restricted-commerce-verification/age-verified-delivery/adult-signature-attempt-fail"},"next":{"title":"年龄验证记录最小化留存与举证（联148）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/age-restricted-commerce-verification/age-gate-record-risk/age-verification-retention-minimal"}}